iping out humanity, while Caesar tries to maintain dominance over his community of intelligent apes.","description_fr":"Une nation de plus en plus nombreuse de singes évolués, dirigée par César, est menacée par un groupe d’humains qui a survécu au virus dévastateur qui s'est répandu 10 ans plus tôt. Ils parviennent à une trêve fragile, mais de courte durée : les deux camps sont sur le point de se livrer une guerre qui décidera de l’espèce dominante sur Terre.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmDGBE8pGUfQxg37xuBOovQMVmZ.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3SozaNPOYUadcmTPgndDibMyDNC.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.3,"vote_count":12657,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2014","release_date":"2014-07-08","runtime_minutes":130,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["خيال علمي","حركة","دراما","إثارة"],"genre_keys":["scifi","action","drama","thriller"],"similar":["mv59967","mv78","mv912649","mv514345","mv117251","mv412656","mv2207","mv471513"],"director":"مات ريفيس","cast":[{"name":"أندي سركيس","character":"Caesar","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eNGqhebQ4cDssjVeNFrKtUvweV5.jpg"},{"name":"جيسون كلارك","character":"Malcolm","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/quH4y2dto3UAgZOfaM0QriyRLPN.jpg"},{"name":"توبي كيبيل","character":"Koba","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mlYytYJvoEHmhDH2enLtES1098Q.jpg"},{"name":"غاري أولدمان","character":"Dreyfus","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yhaSM5habNNI1Tf4ALRwRk3VvSZ.jpg"},{"name":"كيري رسل","character":"Ellie","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4bLtisDjmCOemk3uC65NAlmdIjz.jpg"},{"name":"كودي سميت-ماكفي","character":"Alexander","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sesCWba9NwPDYDZzbVLs7OgLOti.jpg"},{"name":"Nick Thurston","character":"Blue Eyes","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/x79TukKjK5z9QRqcMTitFdrCtNO.jpg"},{"name":"كارين كونوفال","character":"Maurice","profile_image":"ht